cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If GlassBridge or AGX contributes to your research, please cite this software
  and the exact commit or release used.
title: GlassBridge / AGX
type: software
authors:
  - name: HumanCTO
repository-code: https://github.com/humancto/glass-bridge
url: https://humancto.github.io/glass-bridge/
version: 0.12.0-pre-alpha
abstract: >-
  A research prototype for fast, verifiable optical file exchange across
  disconnected and air-gapped security boundaries using signed, policy-bound
  AGX envelopes, receiver-local quarantine, and auditable release evidence.
keywords:
  - air gap
  - optical data transfer
  - secure file transfer
  - systems security
  - visible light communication
